<p>Talia Mae Bettcher, previously professor of philosophy at California State University, Los Angeles, has accepted a position <span class="BCX4 NormalTextRun SCXW2141535">at the University of Waterloo.</span><span id="more-58216"></span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-58219 aligncenter" src="https://dailynous.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/bettcher-t-m-2026.png" alt="" width="450" height="531" srcset="https://dailynous.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/bettcher-t-m-2026.png 450w, https://dailynous.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/bettcher-t-m-2026-254x300.png 254w, https://dailynous.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/bettcher-t-m-2026-400x472.png 400w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 450px) 100vw, 450px" /></p>
<p>Professor Bettcher is well-known for her work in trans philosophy and feminist philosophy. She is the author of <em><a href="https://www.upress.umn.edu/9781517902575/beyond-personhood/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Beyond Personhood: An Essay in Trans Philosophy</a> </em>(2024), among other works, which you can learn about <a href="https://www.taliamaebettcher.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">here</a> and <a href="https://philpeople.org/profiles/talia-mae-bettcher" target="_blank" rel="noopener">here</a>.</p>
<p>At Waterloo, Bettcher will be t<span class="BCX4 NormalTextRun SCXW2141535">he </span><span class="BCX4 CommentStart NormalTextRun SCXW2141535">Eddie Goldenberg Research </span><span class="BCX4 NormalTextRun SCXW2141535">Chair in Gender-Based Violence Prevention and Trans Community Resilience in the <a href="https://uwaterloo.ca/philosophy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Department of Philosophy</a> in the university&#8217;s new <a class="Hyperlink SCXW2141535 BCX4" href="https://uwaterloo.ca/school-social-political-historical-research/" rel="noreferrer noopener"><span class="BCX4 SCXW2141535 TextRun Underlined" lang="EN-CA" xml:lang="EN-CA">School of Social, Political and Historical Research</span></a>. (According to an <a href="https://uwaterloo.ca/news/waterloo-welcomes-inaugural-eddie-goldenberg-research-chairs" target="_blank" rel="noopener">announcement</a> from the university, &#8220;the </span><span class="BCX4 SCXW198169086 TextRun" lang="EN-CA" xml:lang="EN-CA"><span class="BCX4 NormalTextRun SCXW198169086">Eddie Goldenberg Research Chairs of Canada program [provides]</span><span class="BCX4 NormalTextRun SCXW198169086"> up to $1 billion over 12 years to </span><span class="BCX4 NormalTextRun SCXW198169086">help</span><span class="BCX4 NormalTextRun SCXW198169086"> Canadian post-secondary inst</span><span class="BCX4 NormalTextRun SCXW198169086">itutions </span><span class="BCX4 NormalTextRun SCXW198169086">recruit exceptional international researchers.) </span></span></p><p>The post <a href="https://dailynous.com/2026/08/28/bettcher-from-cal-state-la-to-waterloo/">Bettcher from Cal State LA to Waterloo</a> first appeared on <a href="https://dailynous.com">Daily Nous</a>.</p>